Renault will face a criminal trial in France on aggravated fraud charges over accusations that devices in its diesel cars were designed to cheat clean air laws, the public prosecutor's office told French news agency AFP.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/bd591476-383d-11f1-8ddf-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/AP19024518877630.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/bd591476-383d-11f1-8ddf-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/AP19024518877630.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">e74bcc80-8a7a-11f1-ada7-8f3c1bd1f0c6</guid><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 10:31:57 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/bd591476-383d-11f1-8ddf-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/AP19024518877630.jpg">AP - Christophe Ena</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>International</category><title>Rift deepens as US walks out of UN over French criticism of Trump</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/international/20260728-rift-deepens-as-us-delegation-walks-out-of-un-over-french-criticism-of-trump</link><description>
United States diplomats walked out of a United Nations Security Council meeting on Monday as their French counterparts were speaking, after Paris criticised the Trump administration’s human rights record and backed a second term for human rights chief Volker Turk. The move underlined the growing strain in relations between Washington and one of its closest European allies.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/c0186cbe-8a7e-11f1-ac86-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/063-2275020441.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/c0186cbe-8a7e-11f1-ac86-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/063-2275020441.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">45ffd80c-8a6c-11f1-a512-0331a7041faa</guid><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 19:54:58 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/c0186cbe-8a7e-11f1-ac86-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/063-2275020441.jpg">Getty Images via AFP - SPENCER PLATT</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>International</category><title>Family of missing French tourist demands Japan's national police take over case</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/international/20260729-statue-of-disappeared-frenchwoman-erected-in-japan-as-family-pushes-for-probe</link><description>
